  "body": "Scoped merge recommended by the external acceptance report R8 (WO-01).\n\n- 10 files, +3362/-0 (additive only): contracts/CONTROL_PACKAGE_MANIFEST.json, contracts/SBL_C0_C9_CONTRACT-R9.json, compiled-r9 receipts, tests/test_contract_binding.py, tests/test_control_package_manifest.py, tools/check_control_package.py, the build script\n- 14/14 DOC sha256 + rollup 01b972c8...f9d independently recomputed in this round on the live files\n- the three manifest negatives reproduce locally: 6 passed in a detached worktree at this exact SHA, tree clean afterwards\n- CI on this exact SHA: test (ubuntu-latest) success, test (windows-latest) success\n- fast-forwardable: main is an ancestor of the head\n\nScope ceiling: this merges the control-package pin and its tests. It is NOT a native admission, NOT a Host install and NOT a full-contract pass.",
